---
title: Robert Egert Studio
layout: base.njk
pageType: homepage
hideSidebar: true
description: "Robert Egert is a painter based in Ontario, Canada. Current paintings and a catalogue of works on paper, 1984 to present."
ogImage: "/assets/images/small-worlds/17.jpg"
---

{%- set currentProject = null %}
{%- for project in projects %}
  {%- if project.section == "current" %}
    {%- set currentProject = project %}
  {%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-image">
    <a href="/current-work/">
      {% image currentProject.thumbnail, currentProject.title, "detail", "", true %}
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-right">
    <h1 class="hero-artist">Robert Egert</h1>
    <div class="hero-bio">
      <p>Robert Egert received his BFA from Pratt Institute and an MLA from the City University of New York Center for Cultural Studies. His paintings explore the tension between abstraction and representation through subjects drawn from nature, developing recognizable forms into compositions that invite viewers beyond the familiar and into the qualities of color, shape, and surface. His work has been shown at White Columns, Civilian Warfare, Holly Solomon Gallery, Ethan Pettit Contemporary, SRO Gallery, Valentine Bushwick, and Rockland Center for the Arts, notably. He has also written on art for Flash Art International and Hyperallergic.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-thumbs">
      {%- for artwork in collections.currentWorkArtworks %}
        {%- if loop.index <= 5 %}
      <a href="/current-work/" class="hero-thumb">
        {% image artwork.src, artwork.title, "thumbnail", "hero-thumb__img" %}
      </a>
        {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="hero-bottom">
      <div class="hero-caption">
        <span class="hero-caption-title">{{ collections.currentWorkArtworks[0].title }}</span>
        <span class="hero-caption-details">from {{ currentProject.title }}, 2024&ndash;2026, {{ currentProject.count }} works</span>
      </div>
      <a href="/current-work/" class="hero-link">View Current Work</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
